<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Albert - בוט WhatsApp למנהל מבנה חכם</title>
<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    color: white;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100vw;
}

.presentation-container {
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.slide {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(100px);
    transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    padding: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.slide.active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(0);
}

.slide.prev {
    transform: translateX(-100px);
}

/* Slide 1 - Title */
.slide-1 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    text-align: center;
}

.slide-1 h1 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out;
}

.slide-1 .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.3s both;
}

.albert-logo {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366, #128C7E);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

/* Slide 2 - Solutions */
.slide-2 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
}

.solutions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
}

.solution-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    animation: slideInRight 0.8s ease-out;
    text-align: center;
}

.solution-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.solution-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.solution-item:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

.solution-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

/* Demo slides (3, 4, 5) */
.slide-3 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50 0%, #34495e 100%);
}

.slide-4 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c 0%, #c0392b 100%);
}

.slide-5 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db 0%, #2980b9 100%);
}

.demo-container {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    align-items: center;
}

.whatsapp-mockup {
    width: 350px;
    height: 700px;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.whatsapp-screen {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: #0b141a;
    border-radius: 20px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.whatsapp-header {
    background: #202c33;
    padding: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a3942;
}

.group-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366, #128C7E);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
}

.group-info h3 {
    color: #e9edef;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
}

.group-info p {
    color: #8696a0;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.chat-area {
    height: calc(100% - 120px);
    padding: 20px 15px;
    overflow-y: auto;
}

.message {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    animation: messageSlideIn 0.5s ease-out;
}

.message.user {
    text-align: left;
}

.message.albert {
    text-align: right;
}

.message-bubble {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 80%;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.message.user .message-bubble {
    background: #202c33;
    color: #e9edef;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 5px;
}

.message.albert .message-bubble {
    background: #005c4b;
    color: #e9edef;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 5px;
}

.albert-indicator {
    color: #25D366;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.demo-explanation {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
}

.demo-step {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
}

.demo-step:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
.demo-step:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
.demo-step:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.9s; }

.demo-step h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
}

.step-number {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* Slide 6 - Competitive Advantages */
.slide-6 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
}

.advantages-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
}

.advantage-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    text-align: center;
    animation: slideInUp 0.8s ease-out;
}

.advantage-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.advantage-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.advantage-item:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

.advantage-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

/* Slide 7 - Implementation & Business Model */
.slide-7 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4834d4 0%, #686de0 100%);
}

.implementation-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    text-align: center;
}

.economic-model {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

.timeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
}

.timeline-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideInUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
}

.timeline-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.timeline-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.timeline-item:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
.timeline-item:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.8s; }

.timeline-number {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #4834d4;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
}

.timeline-duration {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* Slide 8 - Cost Analysis */
.slide-8 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7e1d7e 0%, #9f5bec 100%);
}

.cost-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    text-align: center;
}

.cost-breakdown {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
}

.cost-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    animation: slideInUp 0.8s ease-out;
    text-align: center;
}

.cost-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.cost-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

.total-cost {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

/* Slide 9 - Target Market */
.slide-9 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #3b9ad1 100%);
    text-align: center;
}

.market-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 2rem 0;
}

.market-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    text-align: center;
    animation: slideInUp 0.8s ease-out;
}

.market-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.market-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

/* Slide 10 - Call to Action */
.slide-10 {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #30ec17 100%);
    text-align: center;
}

/* Navigation */
.nav-controls {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    right: 30px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    z-index: 1000;
}

.nav-btn {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.nav-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
}

.slide-counter {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 30px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    z-index: 1000;
}

/* Animations */
@keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

@keyframes slideInRight {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateX(50px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateX(0);
    }
}

@keyframes slideInUp {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(50px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

@keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }
}

@keyframes messageSlideIn {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .slide {
        padding: 1rem;
    }
    
    .demo-container {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .whatsapp-mockup {
        width: 300px;
        height: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .solutions-grid, .advantages-grid, .market-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .timeline {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    
    .cost-breakdown {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        max-width: 400px;
    }
    
    .slide-1 h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem !important;
    }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="presentation-container">

<!-- Slide 1: Title -->
<div class="slide slide-1 active">
    <div class="albert-logo">🤖</div>
    <h1>Albert</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">בוט WhatsApp חכם לניהול מבנים</p>
    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">מהפכת ה-AI  בניהול נכסים</p>
</div>

<!-- Slide 2: Solutions -->
<div class="slide slide-2">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">הפתרונות המוצעים</h1>
    <div class="solutions-grid">
        <div class="solution-item">
            <div class="solution-icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>הפחתת העומס התפעולי</h3>
            <p>הפחתת העומס התפעולי על מוקד השירות בפניות חוזרות ונשנות לגבי אותה בעיה</p>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-item">
            <div class="solution-icon">🚀</div>
            <h3>שיפור זמני התגובה</h3>
            <p>שיפור זמני התגובה לפתרון תקלה והעברת המידע בצורה מהירה</p>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-item">
            <div class="solution-icon">🚨</div>
            <h3>ניהול חירום יעיל</h3>
            <p>עדכון הדיירים במצבי חירום והצעת דרכי התגוננות או תגובה לכל תרחיש</p>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-item">
            <div class="solution-icon">💬</div>
            <h3>שיפור התקשורת</h3>
            <p>שיפור התקשורת בין הדיירים לרשויות ובין הדיירים לחברת האחזקה</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Slide 3: Elevator Demo -->
<div class="slide slide-3">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;">זיהוי מוקדם וטיפול יזום</h1>
    <div class="demo-container">
        <div class="whatsapp-mockup">
            <div class="whatsapp-screen">
                <div class="whatsapp-header">
                    <div class="group-avatar">🏢</div>
                    <div class="group-info">
                        <h3>דיירי המבנה - רחוב ירדן 23</h3>
                        <p>185 חברים</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="chat-area" id="elevatorChat">
                    <div class="message user">
                        <div class="message-bubble">יש בעיה עם מעלית ב'! היא תקועה 😨</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="demo-explanation">
            <div class="demo-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">1</span>זיהוי אוטומטי</h3>
                <p>Albert מזהה מיידית מילות מפתח כמו "מעלית תקועה" ומפעיל פרוטוקול חירום</p>
            </div>
            <div class="demo-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">2</span>העברה למוקדנית</h3>
                <p>התראה מיידית למוקדנית עם פרטי המיקום והבעיה - לפני שנוצר "רעש" במבנה</p>
            </div>
            <div class="demo-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">3</span>מענה מקצועי</h3>
                <p>המוקדנית מתקשרת לדייר ופותחת קריאת שירות בלחיצת כפתור (אינטגרציה למערכת פתיחת קריאות במוקד)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="demo-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">4</span>עדכון לדיירים</h3>
                <p>Albert מעדכן את כל הדיירים על הטיפול, מציע פתרונות זמניים ומעדכן סטטוס טיפול בתקלה וצפי</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Slide 4: Emergency Demo -->
<div class="slide slide-4">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;">ניהול מצבי חירום</h1>
    <div class="demo-container">
        <div class="whatsapp-mockup">
            <div class="whatsapp-screen">
                <div class="whatsapp-header">
